// # Phys Quantum -- Quantum Computing, Open Systems, Tensor Networks, Topological
//
// Logline: Quantum computing (gates, circuits, algorithms, VQE, QAOA, Shor), open quantum systems (Lindblad, Redfield, master equations), tensor networks (DMRG, PEPS, MERA, TEBD), topological quantum (anyons, surface code, FQHE). Partitioned into bounded subpackages <= 8 files.
//
// Setup: Partitioned subpackages under std/science/phys/quantum. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Quantum gates and circuit family (Hadamard, Pauli, CNOT, Toffoli, rotation).
//   2. Quantum algorithms family (Grover, Shor, VQE, QAOA, QFT, HHL).
//   3. Open quantum systems family (Lindblad, Redfield, master equation, quantum jump).
//   4. Tensor network family (DMRG, PEPS, MERA, TEBD, MPO, MPS).
//   5. Topological quantum family (anyons, surface code, toric code, FQHE).
//   6. Quantum error correction and foundation family.

import "gates/anchor.oo";
import "algorithms/anchor.oo";
import "open_systems/anchor.oo";
import "tensor_nets/anchor.oo";
import "topological/anchor.oo";
import "foundation/anchor.oo";
